# COSMIC lifecycle gate evidence markers for QEMU serial logs.
#
# Replace these with exact patterns from your build and hardware traces.
# Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored.

greetd.*requesting "cosmic-greeter"
cosmic-greeter.*session ready
cosmic-session.*session started
arachd.*login handoff complete
ARACH_LIVE: suspend requested
ARACH_LIVE: suspend-resume complete
ARACH_LIVE: user logout
ARACH_LIVE: request poweroff
